WEBVTT

06:01.144 --> 06:03.437
I think I'm just
coming off as annoying.

06:05.315 --> 06:07.065
Oh, hi, Bo. Hi.

06:07.150 --> 06:09.735
I wanted to thank you, Woody,
for saving my flock.

06:09.819 --> 06:12.571
Oh, hey, it was, uh, nothin'.

06:12.655 --> 06:16.950
What do you say I get someone else
to watch the sheep tonight?

06:17.619 --> 06:19.161
Oh, yeah!

06:20.330 --> 06:24.583
Remember, I'm just
a couple of blocks away.

06:24.667 --> 06:26.460
-Yodel-ay-hee-hoo!
-Come on, come on.

06:26.544 --> 06:27.836
Smaller toys up front.

06:29.839 --> 06:31.757
Hey, Woody, come on.
